  "notes": [
    "Costs are verified from printed 2016 rulebook staff index, except Kitchen Hand updated to 5 per official 2021 text.",
    "2021 Custodian triggers for any occupancy method, not only accommodated guests.",
    "2021 Male Floor Housekeeper is not restricted to red guests; the public translation repository has an apparent extra word red, contradicted by official rules and Yucata.",
    "All effects represented here are concise mechanical facts; artwork and full rulebook prose are not included.",
    "Guest order resource counts verified against Yucata public card order tooltip data and card pictures; guest victory points visually read from all 56 public card GIFs.",
    "Yellow guest ids49..62, blue63..76, red77..90, green91..104. All 56 card rewards are transcribed as mechanical facts, crosschecked with 2021 official appendix and public Apache-2.0 reference.",
    "Sculptor49 has 0 printed VP; ignore the mismatching prose joke mentioning 3 VP in older rule descriptions.",
    "Yucata gift card art remains older style for E. Gizia; implement the 2021 bonus action described in JSON, not a full extra turn.",
    "The crowdfunding 2021 rulebook includes 58 guests; two extra promotional guests117/118 are not part of this standard56 deck.",
    "All four alternative day hotels visually checked against public hotelBackA/B/C/D.gif, with connected groups matching printed wall partitions (10 groups per board).",
    "All objective categories A/B/C use 15/10/5 VP for first/second/third claim; full politics1.gif, politics5.gif and politics9.gif were checked.",
    "Blue occupancy size4 bonus is 15 VP, confirmed in groupBonuses.png.",
    "The emperor track scoring table is not a linear position-minus-one function."
  ],
